# Active Directory Enterprise Lab

## 1. Project Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation,
configuration, administration, and security
of an enterprise Active Directory environment.

The lab is designed to simulate a real-world
corporate IT infrastructure.

## 2. Project Objectives

- Deploy Active Directory Domain Services.
- Configure DNS.
- Create and manage users and groups.
- Design Organizational Units (OUs).
- Implement Group Policies (GPOs).
- Configure file server permissions.
- Apply security best practices.
- Implement backup and recovery procedures.
- Troubleshoot common Active Directory issues.

